        "en": "Compassionate and Dedicated Surgical Team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners overwhelmingly praise Dr. Simon and the surgical staff for their exceptional expertise, empathy, and hands-on guidance. Clients frequently mention how thoroughly the team explains surgical procedures and post-operative physical therapy. One reviewer, however, reported an unprofessional and contentious phone interaction with clinic management."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Outstanding Orthopedic and Surgical Outcomes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews highlight consistently successful surgical outcomes across complex orthopedic and soft tissue procedures, including TPLO repairs, patella corrections, and dental surgeries. Pet parents describe dogs making rapid and complete recoveries, often regaining mobility and active lifestyles after other veterinary clinics had offered limited hope."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Transparent and All-Inclusive Flat Rates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients repeatedly commend the clinic's transparent flat-rate pricing model, noting that upfront quotes include surgery, anesthesia, take-home medications, and follow-up physical therapy. Many pet owners emphasize that costs were significantly lower than large corporate animal hospitals, though one client expressed frustration regarding non-itemized billing."
      }
    }
  ],
